          "name": "Everyone's Grudge",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "5/day, as long as the paleberry king is not making a knife attack, it may use its Everyone's Grudge ability on a single target within 60 ft. The target takes 14d8 points of 'holy' damage (Fortitude save DC 22 for half damage). Blue mages may learn this ability as a 6th level spell (Knowledge: Planes DC 27).",
