          "type": "su",
          "description": "There is a 10% chance when a paleberry king takes damage from an attack action or spell made by a foe, it gains an additional use of Everyone's Grudge that it may use as a free action against the character that damaged it. This extra use can only be made against its assailant and only on the round the paleberry king received damage. This ability does activate on damage suffered from sneak attacks and attacks of opportunity. This ability can be used a number of times per round equal to its Dexterity bonus and it also increases the damage by 1 each time it is used. It cannot use this ability on the same opponent twice per round.",
